    {
      "edition": "ASP.NET Core 11 / .NET 11 GA checked 2026-11-14",
      "items": [
        "Current minimal-host templates can insert middleware automatically based on registered services and endpoint metadata. The final ordering is not always identical to historical explicit Startup examples; inspect current .NET 11 documentation and generated diagnostics when order matters. In ASP.NET Core 11, response compression adds Vary: Accept-Encoding to every response when compression is enabled, and Kestrel applies RequestHeadersTimeout to incomplete HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 trailer headers."
